==Drop Locations==
{{DropLocations}}

==Notes==
*Terminal Velocity benefits rifles that fire projectiles with travel time (specifically it can only be equipped on rifles with the hidden <code>PROJECTILE</code> compatibility tag), which include the following:{{Column|2|
**{{Weapon|Aeolak}}
**{{Weapon|Attica}}
**{{Weapon|Boltor}} ({{Weapon|Boltor Prime|Prime}}, {{Weapon|Telos Boltor|Telos}})
**{{Weapon|Buzlok}}
**{{Weapon|Cernos}} ({{Weapon|Rakta Cernos|Rakta}}, {{Weapon|Cernos Prime|Prime}})
**{{Weapon|Dera}} ({{Weapon|Dera Vandal|Vandal}})
**{{Weapon|Daikyu}}
**{{Weapon|Dread}}
**{{Weapon|Fulmin}}
**{{Weapon|Harpak}}
**{{Weapon|Komorex}}
**{{Weapon|Kuva Bramma}}
**{{Weapon|Lanka}}
**{{Weapon|Lenz}}
**{{Weapon|Miter}}
**{{Weapon|Mutalist Cernos}}
**{{Weapon|Mutalist Quanta}}
**{{Weapon|Nataruk}}
**{{Weapon|Ogris}}
**{{Weapon|Panthera}} (primary fire)
**{{Weapon|Paris}} ({{Weapon|Mk1-Paris|Mk1}}, {{Weapon|Paris Prime|Prime}})
**{{Weapon|Penta}} ({{Weapon|Secura Penta|Secura}})
**{{Weapon|Phenmor}}
**{{Weapon|Quanta}} ({{Weapon|Quanta Vandal|Vandal}}) ([[Alternate Fire]])
**{{Weapon|Quellor}} (alt-fire)
**{{Weapon|Simulor}} ({{Weapon|Synoid Simulor|Synoid}})
**{{Weapon|Supra}} ({{Weapon|Supra Vandal|Vandal}})
**{{Weapon|Tetra}} ({{Weapon|Prisma Tetra|Prisma}})
**{{Weapon|Tonkor}}
**{{Weapon|Torid}}
**{{Weapon|Zhuge}} ({{Weapon|Zhuge Prime|Prime}})
**{{Weapon|Zarr}}
}}
*Can also benefit projectile [[Robotic]] weapons that accept rifle mods:
**{{Weapon|Helstrum}}
**{{Weapon|Laser Rifle}} ({{Weapon|Prime Laser Rifle|Prime}})
**{{Weapon|Multron}}
**{{Weapon|Stinger}}
**{{Weapon|Tazicor}}
**{{Weapon|Vulklok}}
*Cannot be equipped on {{Weapon|Baza}} ({{Weapon|Baza Prime|Prime}}), despite having damage falloff.

==Trivia==
*Prior to {{ver|16.7}}, this mod was usable in [[PvP]] games until it was replaced by its own specific PvP mods along with a number of other mods: {{M|Quickdraw}}, {{M|Fast Hands}}, {{M|Slip Magazine}}, {{M|Tactical Pump}}, {{M|Steady Hands}}, {{M|Stabilizer}}, {{M|Burdened Magazine}}, and {{M|Magazine Warp}}.

